# Admin Panel Pages

- Always show error (red) and success (green) alerts using `Alert` + `AlertDescription`
- Use `showMessage(msg, isError)` pattern with 5s auto-dismiss
- Image uploads go through `uploadImage()` from DataContext — never upload directly
- Forms use Radix Dialog for modals with `DialogFooter` containing Cancel + Submit
- Date fields use `<Input type="date">`, not text inputs
- All text in Spanish (labels, buttons, messages)
